        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of early-onset cerebellar ataxia, cerebellar hypoplasia on imaging, and a pathogenic ITPR1 gene mutation",
    "notes": "Genetic confirmation is essential for definitive diagnosis."
